REMN: EQU 0x0000A909 ; scan for next BASIC line
EXCHQT: EQU 0x0000A911
REMER: EQU 0x0000A919
IF: EQU 0x0000A928 ; perform IF
OKGOTO: EQU 0x0000A937
REM: EQU 0x0000A93B ; perform REM
DOCOND: EQU 0x0000A940
DOCO: EQU 0x0000A948
